{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他在最深的投入后，仍对这段亲近感到踏实，信赖也沉得更稳。此前的相处一次次安顿过他，因此这份关系在触到旧缺憾时仍让他安心。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"最深的投入触及难被理解之处后，亲近仍能给他安稳。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前文反复确立了亲近带给他的真实安稳，因此把结尾理解为这份信赖变得更加稳固，有直接的历史依据。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选16\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他对自己仍想靠近这件事感到坦然，热切过后也有由内而来的安稳。先前他已尝过渴望本身的满足，所以这份愿望如今也能安顿他。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始能在热切过后，继续从渴望本身获得安定。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"前文已写出渴望本身能够带来满足与平静，把这种短暂体验延伸为投入之后仍然持久的安定，有依据但多了一步推断。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选7\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "30dcc0e6-8173-463d-8c82-ef1b16b9cc42", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T030525259239Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.094, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T03:06:56.355376+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "07e6c7ec5f4c71abcbc1d99acc82b69d424f707d006dc96b370cc4fc5b956de7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec0663976